#define HELP_STRING "Controls/options:\n\t*File:\n\t\t-Ctrl-O: Open a comics file (PDF, CBR, CBZ ...)\n\t\t-Ctrl-Q: Quit (preferences will be saved)\n\n\t*Fullscreen:\n\t\t-Ctrl-F: Fullscreen mode on/off\n\n\t*Reading mode:\n\t\t-P: Switch to Page mode: only the full pages are displayed\n\t\t-S: Switch to Strip mode: display in strips mode, based on window/page width\n\t\t-C: Switch to Panel (square) mode: display each panel of the comics individually\nwhen possible\n\t\t-Page preview: Display a preview of the full page when in Panel/Strip mode,\nallowing to preview the whole page before reading in details\n\t\t-Ctrl-T: Show/hide the page thumbnails view (full page view on the side)\n\n\t*Navigation:\n\t\t-Left arrow: Go to previous case/previous strip (to previous page in Page mode)\n\t\t-Right arrow: Go to next case/next strip (to next page in Page mode)\n\t\t-Bottom arrow: Go to previous page\n\t\t-Top arrow: Go to next page\n\t\t-Mouse wheel up: Go to previous case/strip/page\n\t\t-Mouse wheel down: Go to next case/strip/page\n\n"
#define HELP_STRING_HTML "<H1>Menus (<I>shortcuts</I>):</H1><BR><H5>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*File:</H5><BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Open</U> (<I>Ctrl-O</I>): Open a comics file (PDF, CBR, CBZ ...)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Quit</U> (<I>Ctrl-Q</I>): Quit (preferences will be saved)<BR><BR><H5>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*View:</H5><BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Fullscreen</U> (<I>Ctrl-F</I>): Fullscreen mode on/off (<I>Esc</I> to exit)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Page preview</U> (<I>Ctrl-P</I>): Display a preview of the full page when in Panel/Strip mode, allowing to preview the whole page before reading in details<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Thumnails</U> (<I>Ctrl-T</I>): Show/hide the pages thumbnails view (full pages view on the side)<BR><BR><H5>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*Reading modes:</H5><BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Page</U> (<I>P</I>): Switch to Page mode: only the full pages are displayed (no Panel detection is done)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Strip</U> (<I>S</I>): Switch to Strip mode: the page display is optimised for the window width (no detection is done)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Panel</U> (<I>C</I>): Switch to Panel (square) mode: display each panel of the comics individually when possible (A detection is done on each page: can be slow with some comics.)<BR><BR><H5>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*Navigation:</H5><BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Previous</U> (<I>Left</I>): Go to previous case/previous strip (to previous page in Page mode)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Next</U> (<I>Right</I>): Go to next case/next strip (to next page in Page mode)<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Previous page</U> (<I>Up</I>): Go to previous page<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Next page</U> (<I>Down</I>): Go to next page<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Mouse wheel UP</U>: Go to previous case/strip/page<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Mouse wheel DOWN</U>: Go to next case/strip/page<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>First page</U> (<I>Home</I>): Go to first page of the comics<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Last page</U> (<I>End</I>): Go to last page of the comics<BR><BR><H5>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*Preferences:</H5><BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Use global preferences</U>: use the same preferences (Reading mode, Thumbnails view...) for all the documents<BR>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<U>Use documents preferences</U>: use different preferences (Reading mode, Thumbnails view...) for each document. Global preferences (most recent) will be applied to any new document open.<BR><BR>"
